---
alwaysApply: true
---
- Use the following structure as standard:
```
app/
    layout.tsx
    page.tsx
    components/
    lib/
    styles/
    api/
```
- Reusable UI elements go in `app/components/`.
- Server utilities and data-fetching functions go in `app/lib/`.
- Use a `types/` folder for shared TypeScript interfaces and types.
- Use a `constants/` folder for enums, configs, and environment constants.